# the manual's screenshots (MANUAL.md): each of Crawl's scenes, mood by mood, its knob pages, what some keys do,
# the cards, and the koto instrument, from the host simulator. Pictures only, no render.
#   tools\docker_run.ps1 sh tools/manual_shots.sh      (into docs/img/manual)
# The simulator's list: 0 Sakura, 1 Koi, 2 Hotaru, 3 Crypt, 4 Forest Ruins, 5 Frozen Lake, 6 Night Sky. A mood is
# reached in 30 s; the knobs' bar is gone 3 s after a turn; the Mood is turned with ALGORITHM, whatever page shows.
wait 800
spin PRESET 1
wait 150
spin PRESET 1
wait 150
spin PRESET 1
wait 6000
expect scene 3
# Crypt
spin ALGO 1
expect knob0 1
wait 500
shot card-mood.png
wait 33000
shot crypt-vigil.png
spin ALGO 1
expect knob0 2
wait 500
wait 33000
shot crypt-procession.png
spin ALGO 1
expect knob0 3
wait 500
wait 33000
shot crypt-sealed.png
spin ALGO 1
expect knob0 4
wait 500
wait 33000
shot crypt-embers.png
tap FX
wait 300
shot crypt-page-scene.png
tap FX
wait 300
shot crypt-page-volume.png
tap FX
wait 300
shot crypt-page-nature.png
tap FX
wait 300
shot crypt-page-music.png
tap FX
wait 300
shot page-key.png
tap FX
wait 300
expect page 0
wait 4000
tap HOME
wait 400
shot card-status.png
wait 3500
tap SEQ
wait 300
shot card-sleep.png
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
